<title>LATVIA: Two yields up, one down at Latvia T-bill auction.</title>
<headline>Two yields up, one down at Latvia T-bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield of two maturities of Latvian T-bills rose at auction on Wednesday while three-month yields slipped, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD(pct) LAST WEEK NO OF BANKS ISSUE  BID   SOLD</p>
<p> One month    4.09	  3.70	 2	   0.75  0.95   0.75</p>
<p> Three-month  5.78	  5.84	 8	   1.50  3.28   1.50</p>
<p> Six-month    6.34	  6.24	 7	   2.0   4.5    2.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
